/span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Translation</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Marketing：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Marketing</span> </span> </div> <div class="ai-overview-foot"><span><i class="ai-key used"></i>Reported use</span><span><i class="ai-key"></i>Unmarked does not mean AI-free</span><span class="ai-overview-arrow">View evidence ↗</span></div> </a>  <div class="actions"> <a class="btn primary" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5138990/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam store ↗</a> <button class="btn" id="saveBtn" type="button" title="Saved in this browser only">☆ Save</button> <button class="btn" id="shareBtn" type="button">Share</button> </div> <dl class="facts"> <div><dt>Steam App ID</dt><dd><code>5138990</code><button class="copy" id="copyId" type="button">Copy</button></dd></div> <div><dt>Developer</dt><dd>SkorpionDev</dd></div> <div><dt>Publisher</dt><dd>SkorpionDev</dd></div> <div><dt>Release date</dt><dd>2026-12-07（计划；核查时尚未发售）</dd></div> <div><dt>Price</dt><dd>Not confirmed</dd></div> <div><dt>Platforms</dt><dd>Windows</dd></div> <div><dt>Genres</dt><dd>Casual / Simulation</dd></div> <div><dt>Tags</dt><dd>单人、Steam 成就、完全支持控制器、自定义音量控制、#category_playable_at_your_own_pace、无需应对快速反应事件、随时保存、立体声、Steam 云、统计数据、Steam 排行榜、家庭共享</dd></div>   <div><dt>Languages</dt><dd class="clamp">英语, 法语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 日语, 韩语, 波兰语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 葡萄牙语 - 葡萄牙, 俄语, 简体中文, 西班牙语 - 拉丁美洲, 土耳其语</dd></div> <div><dt>Website</dt><dd><a href="https://impress.games/press-kit/skorpiondev/unharvest" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">impress.games ↗</a></dd></div>  </dl> </aside> </section> <nav class="section-nav" aria-label="On this page"> <a href="#ai">AI use</a> <a href="#evidence">Evidence</a> <a href="#steam">Steam data</a> <a href="#developer">Developer</a> <a href="#sources">Sources &amp; corrections</a> </nav> <section class="section" id="ai"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">AI USE</div><h2>Eight areas, separate answers</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">0 / 8 areas with reported AI use</div> </div> <div class="status-note tone-blue"> <strong>No verified AI evidence found</strong><span>The review found no verified generative-AI production claim. This does not confirm zero AI use.</span> </div> <p class="section-lede">A reverse-farming incremental game where the player drains life from the world, infecting crops and upgrading plagues. This review found no verifiable evidence of generative AI use: the Steam store page carries no AI disclosure and no related statement appeared in press coverage or developer channels. A community thread questioned whether collectible illustrations were AI-generated, but the developer did not reply and other players disagreed.</p>  <div class="table-wrap"> <table class="ai-table"> <thead> <tr><th>Area</th><th>Scope</th><th>Status</th><th>Notes</th></tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><strong>In-game generation</strong><small>In-game AI</small></td> <td class="muted">Content generated during play</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Code</strong><small>Code</small></td> <td class="muted">Programming and development</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Art</strong><small>Art</small></td> <td class="muted">Visual assets</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">A community poster suspected the stick-figure collectible art was AI-generated; the developer did not reply, other players disagreed, and the claim is unverified, so it does not establish generative AI use in art.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Music &amp; sound</strong><small>Music &amp; SFX</small></td> <td class="muted">Music and sound</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Voice</strong><small>Voice</small></td> <td class="muted">Voice and dialogue audio</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Writing</strong><small>Writing</small></td> <td class="muted">Story and written content</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Translation</strong><small>Translation</small></td> <td class="muted">Translation and localization</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Marketing</strong><small>Marketing</small></td> <td class="muted">Promotional material</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="legend"> <span><i class="dot used"></i>Reported use (official / third-party)</span> <span><i class="dot not_stated"></i>Not stated (not proof of no use)</span> <span><i class="dot claimed_none"></i>Developer claims no AI</span> <span><i class="dot unreviewed"></i>Unreviewed</span> </div>  <details class="callout"> <summary><strong>How to interpret these statuses</strong></summary> <p>Reported AI use: 0/8. Developer no-use claims: 0/8. Claims are not independent verification; not stated does not mean no AI use.</p> </details> <p class="source-line"> Primary source:<a href="https://unharvest.wiki/reviews/unharvest-review" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Third-party source ↗</a> <span> · Reviewed 2026-10-30</span> </p> </section> <section class="section" id="evidence"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">EVIDENCE</div><h2>Evidence</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">5 sources</div> </div> <div class="timeline"> <article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Third-party source</span> <time>2026-10-31</time> </div> <h3>Unharvest Wiki 试玩评测</h3> <p>Developed and published by SkorpionDev, the PC demo offers a focused 23 to 30-minute slice of reverse-farming incremental gameplay ahead of its planned December 7, 2026 release date.</p> <a href="https://unharvest.wiki/reviews/unharvest-review" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Third-party source</span> <time>2026-10-31</time> </div> <h3>IndieBunny 预告片报道</h3> <p>Unharvest is a slow-burn incremental game where you design and upgrade plagues to wither every living thing you encounter.</p> <a href="https://indiebunny.com/news/unharvest-official-trailer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Steam store</span> <time>2026-10-30</time> </div> <h3>Steam 商店页：AI 生成内容披露栏核查</h3> <p>完整商店页未显示 AI 生成内容披露栏；未披露不等于未使用。</p> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5138990/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Steam discussion index</span> <time>2026-10-30</time> </div> <h3>Steam 讨论区首页核查</h3> <p>英文讨论区首页显示 15 个主题（总数 42）；仅覆盖首页。</p> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5138990/discussions/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Community report</span> <time>2026-10-30</time> </div> <h3>Was the collectibles AI generated?</h3> <p>Something about the color and artificing is very familiar with AI art. Specifically talking about the stickman drawings you can pick up in the field. No hate for generative AI usage, but if it was AI, the fair thing to do is put up a disclaimer about it wbirch15 View Profile View Posts Oct 21 @ 7:43pm Report this post booo #1 erandomone View Profile View Posts Oct 21 @ 8:44pm Report this post Obligatory AI expert accusing a game of having AI art. Can mark that bingo cell. #2 Owlie View Profile View Posts Oct 21 @ 11:07pm Report this post Originally posted by erandomone : Obligatory AI expert accusing a game of having AI art. Can mark that bingo cell. Not trying to be malicious. Just had a suspicion and wanted to ask if it&#39;s true or not #3 Shapechanger View Profile View Posts Oct 21 @ 11:12pm Report this post For what it&#39;s worth, I don&#39;t think so. #4 Bob View Profile View Posts Oct 21 @ 11:21pm Report this post its ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ stick figure art? If you use AI for stick figure art your either the dumbest human alive, or entirely unable to physically draw. A toddler can draw stick figures dude. #5 BlueSun View Profile View Posts Oct 22 @ 9:47am Report this post Smoothest brain in the world #6 Waffle View Profile View Posts Oct 24 @ 9:01am Report this post The entire game was lol #7 Max58201 View Profile View Posts 1 Oct 25 @ 11:02am Report this post Originally posted by Owlie : Originally posted by erandomone : Obligatory AI expert accusing a game of having AI art. Can mark that bingo cell. Not trying to be malicious. Just had a suspicion and wanted to ask if it&#39;s true or not you are accusing stick figures of being AI. there is a point where suspicion crosses the line into ignorant accusations. #8 Frizzle View Profile View Posts Oct 25 @ 7:25pm Report this post Originally posted by Owlie : No hate for generative AI usage yeah no ♥♥♥♥, you would never try to draw something lol #9 chazdragoon View Profile View Posts Oct 25 @ 11:36pm Report this post unkindly, go ♥♥♥♥ yourself you AI Deranged Karen. Preferably with a plague coated rod. #10</p> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5138990/discussions/0/569300839163876152/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article> </div> <details class="callout"><summary><strong>Review notes (expand)</strong></summary><p>Reviewed the full English Steam store page and confirmed there is no AI-generated content disclosure; the English discussion homepage showed 15 topics (42 total), and the thread &quot;Was the collectibles AI generated?&quot; was read in full: the poster suspected the stick-figure collectible art was AI-generated, none of the 10 replies came from the developer, and most players disagreed. That suspicion is community speculation and cannot support an official area finding. This title was searched twice with 27 results logged and two raw sources read (Unharvest Wiki demo review, IndieBunny trailer report), neither mentioning generative AI. The game is scheduled for 7 December 2026. All eight areas are marked as not stated.</p></details> </section> <section class="section" id="steam"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">STEAM DATA</div><h2>Steam data</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">Public data snapshot</div> </div> <div class="stat-grid"> <div class="stat"> <span>Online now</span> <strong>—</strong> <small>Steam public API</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Steam reviews</span> <strong>—</strong> <small>No data</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Positive reviews</span> <strong>—</strong> <small>All languages</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Release date</span> <strong>2026</strong> <small>2026-12-07（计划；核查时尚未发售）</small> </div> </div> <div class="steam-desc"><h3>Steam description</h3><p>在这款反向种田增量游戏中，吸干你周围一切的生命。感染所有生长之物，升级你的瘟疫，让世界枯萎，直到再无活物。</p></div> <p class="source-line"> Player and review figures are Steam snapshots taken at build time and may be delayed. <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5138990/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View current data on Steam ↗</a> </p> </section> <section class="section" id="developer"> <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">DEVELOPER</div><h2>Developer</h2></div></div> <div class="dev-card"> <div class="dev-avatar">SK</div> <div class="dev-body"> <h3>SkorpionDev</h3> <p>Developer / publisher</p> <div class="dev-links"> <a href="https://impress.games/press-kit/skorpiondev/unharvest" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Website ↗</a> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/search/?developer=SkorpionDev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Developer on Steam ↗</a> <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Unharvest%EF%BC%885138990%EF%BC%89%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99&body=%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%9Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F5138990-unharvest%2F%0A%0A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claim / correct ↗</a> </div> </div> </div>  </section> <section class="section" id="community"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY</div><h2>Player impressions</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">Separate from official disclosures</div> </div> <p class="section-lede">Player impressions are not evidence of AI use. Votes do not change developer disclosure findings.</p> <form id="voteForm" class="vote-form"> <select id="voteSelect" required aria-label="Choose your impression"> <option value="">Your impression…</option> <option value="no_ai_suspected">I suspect no AI use</option> <option value="some_ai_suspected">I suspect some AI use</option> <option value="heavy_ai_suspected">I suspect extensive AI use</option> <option value="all_ai_suspected">I suspect AI throughout</option> </select> <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Submit</button> </form> <p id="voteMessage" class="muted" role="status"></p> <div id="voteCounts" class="vote-counts"></div> <p class="source-line">Feedback availability does not affect the evidence. One vote per network per game.</p> </section> <section class="section" id="sources"> <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">SOURCES</div><h2>Sources &amp; review limits</h2></div></div> <ul class="source-list"> <li> <span>Third-party source</span> <a href="https://unharvest.wiki/reviews/unharvest-review" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Unharvest Wiki 试玩评测</a> <time>2026-10-31</time> </li><li> <span>Third-party source</span> <a href="https://indiebunny.com/news/unharvest-official-trailer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IndieBunny 预告片报道</a> <time>2026-10-31</time> </li><li> <span>Steam store</span> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5138990/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam 商店页：AI 生成内容披露栏核查</a> <time>2026-10-30</time> </li><li> <span>Steam discussion index</span> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5138990/discussions/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam 讨论区首页核查</a> <time>2026-10-30</time> </li><li> <span>Community report</span> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5138990/discussions/0/569300839163876152/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Was the collectibles AI generated?</a> <time>2026-10-30</time> </li> <li> <span>Steam store</span> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5138990/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Unharvest · App 5138990</a> <time></time> </li> </ul> <div class="callout"> <strong>Found an error?</strong> <p> Please include an original source, date and specific correction. <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Unharvest%EF%BC%885138990%EF%BC%89%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99&body=%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%9Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F5138990-unharvest%2F%0A%0A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Suggest a correction ↗</a> or <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Unharvest%20%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open a GitHub issue ↗</a>。
</p> </div> </section> <div class="share-bar"> <span>Share this game</span> <button class="btn" id="shareBtn2" type="button">Copy link</button> <a class="btn" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Does%20Unharvest%20use%20AI%3F&url=https%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F5138990-unharvest%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Share on X</a> <a class="btn" href="https://www.reddit.com/submit?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F5138990-unharvest%2F&title=Unharvest%20%E2%80%94%20AI%20use%20evidence" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Reddit</a> </div> </main> <div class="tf-cta-wrap"><a class="tf-cta" href="https://toolfavor.com/?utm_source=gameaichecker&utm_medium=footer_button" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3l1.9 4.6L18.5 9.5l-4.6 1.9L12 16l-1.9-4.6L5.5 9.5l4.6-1.9z"></path><path d="M19 15l.8 1.9 1.9.8-1.9.8L19 20.4l-.8-1.9-1.9-.8 1.9-.8z"></path></svg><span>Discover more useful tools on ToolFavor</span><svg class="tf-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="wrap"> <span>Game AI Checker · Independent of Valve / Steam.</span> <span>Evidence first · Not stated does not mean unused</span> </div> </footer> <dialog class="lightbox" id="lightbox"> <button id="closeLightbox" type="button" aria-label="Close">×</button> <img id="lightboxImg" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high"> <div class="lightbox-caption" id="lightboxCaption"></div> </dialog> <script>
    (() => {
      const app = document.getElementById('app');
      const labels = JSON.parse(app?.dataset.ui || '{}');
      const tx = key => labels[key] || key;
      const en = document.documentElement.lang === 'en';
      const key = app?.dataset.gameKey || '';
      const slug = app?.dataset.slug || '';

      document.querySelectorAll('img[data-fallback]').forEach((img) => {
        const fallback = img.dataset.fallback;
        if (!fallback) return;
        img.addEventListener('error', function onError() {
          img.removeEventListener('error', onError);
          img.dataset.fallback = '';
          img.src = fallback;
          img.addEventListener('error', () => { img.style.display = 'none'; }, { once: true });
        });
      });

      const heroImg = document.getElementById('heroImg');
      const heroMedia = document.getElementById('heroMedia');
      const thumbs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.thumb'));
      const counter = document.getElementById('mediaCount');
      const pauseBtn = document.getElementById('pauseBtn');
      let index = 0;
      let paused = false;
      let hovering = false;
      let timer = null;

      const warmedImages = new Set();
      function warm(full) {
        if (!full || warmedImages.has(full)) return null;
        warmedImages.add(full);
        const image = new Image();
        image.decoding = 'async';
        image.src = full;
        return image;
      }
      // Browse one frame ahead so the lightbox never waits on a cold round trip.
      function warmAround() {
        if (!thumbs.length) return;
        const upcoming = [thumbs[index], thumbs[(index + 1) % thumbs.length]];
        const run = () => upcoming.forEach((thumb) => thumb && warm(thumb.dataset.full));
        if (typeof window.requestIdleCallback === 'function') window.requestIdleCallback(run, { timeout: 1500 });
        else setTimeout(run, 500);
      }

      function show(next) {
        if (!heroImg || !thumbs.length) return;
        index = (next + thumbs.length) % thumbs.length;
        const thumb = thumbs[index];
        heroImg.src = thumb.dataset.src || heroImg.src;
        heroImg.dataset.full = thumb.dataset.full || heroImg.dataset.full;
        thumbs.forEach((item, position) => item.classList.toggle('active', position === index));
        if (counter) counter.textContent = `${index + 1} / ${thumbs.length}`;
        warmAround();
      }

      function schedule() {
        clearInterval(timer);
        if (thumbs.length < 2 || paused || hovering || document.hidden) return;
        timer = setInterval(() => show(index + 1), 6000);
      }

      thumbs.forEach((thumb) => {
        thumb.addEventListener('click', () => {
          show(Number(thumb.dataset.index || 0));
          schedule();
        });
      });

      document.getElementById('prevBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => { show(index - 1); schedule(); });
      document.getElementById('nextBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => { show(index + 1); schedule(); });
      pauseBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        paused = !paused;
        pauseBtn.textContent = paused ? '▶' : 'Ⅱ';
        pauseBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', paused ? tx("继续轮播") : tx("暂停轮播"));
        schedule();
      });
      heroMedia?.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => { hovering = true; schedule(); });
      heroMedia?.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => { hovering = false; schedule(); });
      document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', schedule);
      schedule();

      const appId = app?.dataset.appid;
      if (appId && heroImg && !heroImg.getAttribute('src')?.startsWith('/images/steam/')) {
        fetch(`/api/steam-media?id=${encodeURIComponent(appId)}`)
          .then((response) => (response.ok ? response.json() : Promise.reject()))
          .then((data) => {
            if (!data?.available) return;
            for (const shot of data.screenshots || []) {
              const src = shot.thumbnail || shot.full;
              const full = shot.full || shot.thumbnail;
              if (!src || thumbs.some((thumb) => thumb.dataset.full === full)) continue;
              const thumb = document.createElement('button');
              thumb.className = 'thumb';
              thumb.type = 'button';
              thumb.dataset.src = src;
              thumb.dataset.full = full;
              thumb.dataset.index = String(thumbs.length);
              thumb.setAttribute('aria-label', `第 ${thumbs.length + 1} 张图片`);
              const image = document.createElement('img');
              image.src = src;
              image.alt = '';
              image.loading = 'lazy';
              image.decoding = 'async';
              thumb.append(image);
              thumb.addEventListener('click', () => { show(Number(thumb.dataset.index)); schedule(); });
              document.getElementById('thumbs')?.append(thumb);
              thumbs.push(thumb);
            }
            if (counter) counter.textContent = `${index + 1} / ${thumbs.length}`;
            const countText = document.getElementById('mediaCountText');
            if (countText) countText.textContent = `${thumbs.length} ${en ? 'official images' : '张官方图片'}`;
            schedule();

            if (data.movies?.length) {
              const mediaCol = document.querySelector('.media-col');
              let videos = document.querySelector('.videos');
              if (!videos && mediaCol) {
                videos = document.createElement('div');
                videos.className = 'videos';
                videos.innerHTML = '<div class="mini-title"></div><div class="video-grid"></div>';
                videos.querySelector('.mini-title').textContent = tx('宣传视频');
                mediaCol.append(videos);
              }
              const grid = videos?.querySelector('.video-grid');
              if (grid) {
                const first = data.movies.find((movie) => movie.webm || movie.mp4);
                if (first) {
                  const player = document.createElement('video');
                  player.className = 'trailer';
                  player.controls = true;
                  player.preload = 'none';
                  player.poster = first.thumbnail || '';
                  player.src = first.webm || first.mp4;
                  grid.before(player);
                }
                for (const movie of data.movies.slice(0, 4)) {
                  if (!movie.thumbnail) continue;
                  const link = document.createElement('a');
                  link.className = 'video-card';
                  link.href = data.steamUrl || `https://store.steampowered.com/app/${appId}/`;
                  link.target = '_blank';
                  link.rel = 'noopener noreferrer';
                  const poster = document.createElement('img');
                  poster.src = movie.thumbnail;
                  poster.alt = movie.name || tx("宣传视频");
                  poster.loading = 'lazy';
                  const label = document.createElement('span');
                  label.textContent = `${movie.name || tx("观看宣传视频")} ↗`;
                  link.append(poster, label);
                  grid.append(link);
                }
              }
            }
          })
          .catch(() => {});
      }

      const lightbox = document.getElementById('lightbox');
      const lightboxImg = document.getElementById('lightboxImg');
      const lightboxCaption = document.getElementById('lightboxCaption');
      function openLightbox() {
        if (!heroImg || !lightbox || !lightboxImg) return;
        const full = heroImg.dataset.full || heroImg.src;
        // The 1280 hero frame is already decoded, so the dialog shows at once and upgrades in place.
        lightboxImg.src = heroImg.currentSrc || heroImg.src;
        lightboxImg.alt = heroImg.alt || '';
        if (lightboxCaption) lightboxCaption.textContent = heroImg.alt || '';
        if (typeof lightbox.showModal === 'function') lightbox.showModal();
        const larger = warm(full);
        if (larger) larger.onload = () => { lightboxImg.src = larger.src; };
      }
      document.getElementById('openLightbox')?.addEventListener('click', openLightbox);
      heroImg?.addEventListener('click', openLightbox);
      [document.getElementById('openLightbox'), heroMedia].forEach((node) => node?.addEventListener('pointerenter', () => warm(heroImg?.dataset.full), { once: true }));
      document.getElementById('closeLightbox')?.addEventListener('click', () => lightbox?.close());
      lightbox?.addEventListener('click', (event) => { if (event.target === lightbox) lightbox.close(); });

      const saveBtn = document.getElementById('saveBtn');
      const starKey = `gac:star:${slug}`;
      function paintStar() {
        if (!saveBtn) return;
        const active = localStorage.getItem(starKey) === '1';
        saveBtn.textContent = active ? tx("★ 已收藏") : tx("☆ 收藏");
        saveBtn.classList.toggle('active', active);
      }
      saveBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (localStorage.getItem(starKey) === '1') localStorage.removeItem(starKey);
        else localStorage.setItem(starKey, '1');
        paintStar();
      });
      paintStar();

      async function copyLink() {
        const url = window.location.href;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(url);
          flash(tx("链接已复制"));
        } catch {
          window.prompt(tx("复制链接"), url);
        }
      }
      function flash(message) {
        const target = document.getElementById('voteMessage') || document.getElementById('shareBtn');
        if (!target) return;
        const original = target.textContent;
        if (target.id === 'voteMessage') {
          target.textContent = message;
          setTimeout(() => { target.textContent = original; }, 2200);
        } else {
          target.textContent = message;
          setTimeout(() => { target.textContent = tx("分享"); }, 2200);
        }
      }
      async function share() {
        if (navigator.share) {
          try {
            await navigator.share({ title: document.title, url: window.location.href });
            return;
          } catch {}
        }
        copyLink();
      }
      document.getElementById('shareBtn')?.addEventListener('click', share);
      document.getElementById('shareBtn2')?.addEventListener('click', copyLink);

      document.getElementById('copyId')?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
        const id = app?.dataset.appid;
        if (!id) return;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(id);
          flash(tx("App ID 已复制"));
        } catch {}
      });

      const voteForm = document.getElementById('voteForm');
      const voteMessage = document.getElementById('voteMessage');
      const voteCounts = document.getElementById('voteCounts');
      const voteSelect = document.getElementById('voteSelect');
      const voteNames = {
        no_ai_suspected: tx("认为没有使用 AI"),
        some_ai_suspected: tx("认为部分使用 AI"),
        heavy_ai_suspected: tx("认为大量使用 AI"),
        all_ai_suspected: tx("认为几乎全程使用 AI"),
      };
      function showCounts(counts) {
        if (!voteCounts) return;
        voteCounts.replaceChildren();
        for (const [code, label] of Object.entries(voteNames)) {
          const value = Number(counts?.[code] || 0);
          if (!value) continue;
          const row = document.createElement('div');
          row.textContent = en ? `${value} players ${label}` : `${value} 位玩家${label}`;
          voteCounts.append(row);
        }
      }
      if (voteForm && key) {
        fetch(`/api/feedback?game=${encodeURIComponent(key)}`)
          .then((response) => (response.ok ? response.json() : Promise.reject()))
          .then((data) => {
            showCounts(data.counts);
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("反馈功能已启用。");
          })
          .catch(() => {
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("匿名反馈暂未启用，等待管理员配置数据库。");
          });
        voteForm.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
          event.preventDefault();
          const vote = voteSelect?.value;
          if (!vote) return;
          const button = voteForm.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
          if (button) button.disabled = true;
          try {
            const response = await fetch('/api/feedback', {
              method: 'POST',
              headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },
              body: JSON.stringify({ game: key, vote }),
            });
            const data = await response.json();
            if (!response.ok) {
              if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = response.status === 409 ? tx("该网络已对本游戏投过票。") : tx("提交失败，请稍后再试。");
              if (data.counts) showCounts(data.counts);
            } else {
              if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("反馈已记录，谢谢参与。");
              showCounts(data.counts);
              voteForm.reset();
            }
          } catch {
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("网络错误，请稍后重试。");
          } finally {
            if (button) button.disabled = false;
          }
        });
      }

      const navLinks = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.section-nav a'));
      if (navLinks.length && 'IntersectionObserver' in window) {
        const linksById = new Map(navLinks.map((link) => [link.getAttribute('href')?.slice(1), link]));
        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
          for (const entry of entries) {
            if (!entry.isIntersecting) continue;
            navLinks.forEach((link) => link.classList.remove('active'));
            linksById.get(entry.target.id)?.classList.add('active');
          }
        }, { rootMargin: '-35% 0px -55% 0px' });
        document.querySelectorAll('section[id]').forEach((section) => observer.observe(section));
      }
    })();
  </script> <script>
    document.getElementById('game-language')?.addEventListener('change', (event) => {
      const slug = document.getElementById('app')?.dataset.slug;
      if (slug) window.location.assign('/games/' + (event.target.value === 'en' ? '' : event.target.value + '/') + encodeURIComponent(slug) + '/' + location.hash);
    });
  </script> </body> </html>